{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_197_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，齊侯伐徐。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"二、楚子誘戎蠻子殺之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"三、夏，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，己亥，晉侯夷卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"五、九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"六、季孫意如如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_197_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_197","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，葬晉昭公。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}